管理任务 ↗</button></div>\n          <p class="hint">卸载不删除已有结果；停用将阻止后续启动。</p>\n        </details>\n      </details>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n    <section class="cloud-my-entry od-surface" aria-label="云端托管状态">\n    <strong>云端托管</strong><span id="cloud-my-state" role="status" aria-live="polite">托管未启用</span>\n  </section>\n    <section class="cloud-panel od-stack" aria-label="云控管理">\n      <header class="cloud-panel-head od-toolbar">\n        <div class="cloud-panel-heading"><strong>云控</strong><p class="hint">与当前目标网页并排查看云任务及执行状态。</p></div>\n        <button type="button" id="cloud-overview-refresh" class="od-icon-button" title="刷新云控状态" aria-label="刷新云控状态"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 11a8 8 0 0 0-14-5L4 8m0-5v5h5M4 13a8 8 0 0 0 14 5l2-2m0 5v-5h-5"></path></svg></button>\n      </header>\n      <section class="cloud-overview od-surface" aria-label="云控实时概览">\n        <p id="cloud-overview-state" role="status" aria-live="polite">正在读取云控状态…</p>\n        <div class="cloud-overview-metrics">\n          <div><span>提供者</span><strong id="cloud-overview-provider">检测中</strong></div>\n          <div><span>连接</span><strong id="cloud-overview-connection">检测中</strong></div>\n          <div><span>执行宿主</span><strong id="cloud-overview-host">检测中</strong></div>\n          <div><span>执行槽</span><strong id="cloud-overview-slot">检测中</strong></div>\n          <div><span>已批准任务</span><strong id="cloud-overview-tasks">—</strong></div>\n          <div><span>云请求数</span><strong id="cloud-overview-requests">—</strong></div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n      <section class="cloud-requests od-surface" aria-label="云请求状态样本">\n        <div class="cloud-section-title od-toolbar"><strong>请求状态</strong><span class="hint">最多 5 条，脱敏显示</span></div>\n        <ol id="cloud-request-samples" class="cloud-request-samples"><li>暂无云请求</li></ol>\n      </section>\n    <details id="cloud-hosting" class="task-scope-panel"><summary>连接与授权 <span id="cloud-brief" class="cloud-status-brief">未配对</span></summary>\n        <label>提供者地址 <input id="cloud-url" type="url" placeholder="https://可信提供者地址"></label>\n        <label>提供者身份 <input id="cloud-provider-id" autocomplete="off"></label>\n        <label>配对码 <input id="cloud-pairing-code" type="password" autocomplete="off"></label>\n        <label><input id="cloud-loopback" type="checkbox">明确允许固定本地测试提供者 HTTP/WS</label>\n        <p class="hint">云控框架已内置，无需在「工具」中导入。开发回环服务请输入 http://127.0.0.1:43112 并明确允许本地测试；普通服务器应使用 HTTPS。</p>\n        <button id="cloud-pair" type="button">配对提供者</button>\n        <p>请先在「我的」安装并选择任务。托管授权固定当前安装版本、摘要、授权代次及该任务网站范围。</p>\n        <label><input id="cloud-consent" type="checkbox">批准所选固定任务和网站范围，在合法浏览器执行宿主可用时运行</label>\n        <label><input id="cloud-result-consent" type="checkbox">允许该固定任务结果回传</label>\n        <div><button id="cloud-approve" type="button">批准并启用托管</button><button id="cloud-stop" type="button">停止托管并请求取消</button><button id="cloud-unpair" type="button">解除配对</button><button id="cloud-refresh" type="button">核对状态</button></div>\n        <p class="hint">关闭 Side Panel 后不承诺无人值守执行。停止后保留取消处理中、退休待核对和未知结果；正常重连复用已有授权。</p>\n        <p id="cloud-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">尚未配对</p>\n      </details>\n\n      <p class="hint">云控复用「我的」已安装授权的任务和原 RunHost。切换选项卡不会启动第二个执行器；关闭 Side Panel 后不承诺任务继续运行。</p>\n    </section>\n\n  </div>\n  <div id="workbench-tools" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-tools" class="od-page" data-workbench-page="tools" hidden>\n    <section id="sidebar-tools" class="sidebar-tools" aria-label="自定义工具">\n      <section id="sidebar-tool-action-review" class="sidebar-tool-action-review od-surface" role="group" aria-label="确认当前工具操作" hidden>\n        <p id="sidebar-tool-action-summary" role="status"></p>\n        <div class="sidebar-tool-action-buttons">\n          <button type="button" id="sidebar-tool-action-continue" class="od-button">继续</button>\n          <button type="button" id="sidebar-tool-action-cancel" class="od-button od-button--secondary">取消</button>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n      <div id="sidebar-tool-list-view">\n        <div class="sidebar-tools-head od-toolbar">\n          <strong>已安装工具</strong>\n          <div class="sidebar-tools-actions od-toolbar" role="group" aria-label="添加和管理工具">\n            <button type="button" id="sidebar-tool-discover-toggle" class="od-icon-button" aria-label="添加工具" title="查找并安装官方工具" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="sidebar-tool-discover-panel"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></button>\n            <button type="button" id="sidebar-tool-market" class="od-icon-button" aria-label="打开应用市场" title="在新标签页打开完整应用市场"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 10h16l-1.5-6h-13L4 10Zm2 0v10h12V10M10 20v-6h4v6"></path></svg></button>\n            <button type="button" id="sidebar-tool-import-trigger" class="od-icon-button" aria-label="导入工具文件" title="导入本地工具文件" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="sidebar-tool-import"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 16V4m-5 5 5-5 5 5M4 16v4h16v-4"></path></svg></button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div id="sidebar-tool-import" class="sidebar-tool-import od-surface" hidden>\n          <div class="sidebar-tool-import-head od-toolbar">\n            <strong>导入工具</strong>\n            <button type="button" id="sidebar-tool-import-close" class="sidebar-tool-icon-action od-icon-button" title="取消导入" aria-label="取消导入"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 5l14 14M19 5 5 19"></path></svg></button>\n          </div>\n          <label for="sidebar-tool-file">选择 .opendesk-tool.json 文件</label>\n          <input id="sidebar-tool-file" type="file" accept=".json,application/json" aria-describedby="sidebar-tool-file-error">\n          <p id="sidebar-tool-file-error" class="sidebar-tool-file-error" role="alert" hidden></p>\n          <p class="sidebar-tool-import-hint">选择文件和安装都不会运行代码；安装后由你点击“打开”启动工具。</p>\n          <div id="sidebar-tool-preview" 